{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "63e72268-acd3-8f1e-8882-1fff8f8133e6",
  "created_at": "2026-02-24T10:50:18-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Leo G. Ricci",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:46:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:47:00-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Good morning. My name is Leo Ricci. I have a tree down. The roots pulled right up out of the ground. I would like to know who I call about that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:47:11-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mr. Ricci, I can help with that. Is this a tree on your own property, or is it out by the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:47:19-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is in my yard. Front, near the sidewalk. It came down in the nor'easter. Last weekend, Saturday into Sunday. I found it Sunday morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:47:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, so it came down sometime during the storm. And what's the address there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:47:34-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "14 Bacheller Street. In the Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:47:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "14 Bacheller Street, got it. Now, is the tree lying across the sidewalk or the road at all, or is it all on your lawn?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:47:46-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Part of it is on the sidewalk. The top. The roots are up in the air on my side. There is a big hole of dirt where they came out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:47:57-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is it touching any wires, that you can see? Electric, cable, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:48:03-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do not believe so. There is a wire up high, but the tree is not near it. It fell the other way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:48:11-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. That's good to know. Then what I'd say is, if it's blocking the public sidewalk, we want to know about it so somebody can look at it. I'll put in a report with the address and what you've told me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:48:25-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I want to ask something. Is it the city that takes it away, or is it me, the owner, or is it the electric company? I do not know which one handles it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:48:37-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, that's a fair question. Generally, if the tree is on private property, removing it is the owner's responsibility. If it's a city street tree, in the public strip, then the city handles it. And if it's down on utility wires, that's the utility. Yours sounds like it may be your tree, but the part on the sidewalk we'd have a crew look at to clear the walkway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:48:59-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. So the city may come for the sidewalk part. And I would hire someone for the rest."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:49:06-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's probably how it'll shake out, yes. Someone will take a look and confirm whether it's a city tree or yours. Let me read back so I have it right. Leo Ricci, 14 Bacheller Street, a tree uprooted in the weekend storm, partly across the sidewalk, no wires involved. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:49:23-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is correct."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:49:25-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And is a good callback number 401-555-0199?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:49:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. That is my cell phone. 401-555-0199."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:49:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Somebody may call you before they come out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:49:35-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I will say, I have never called this number before. I did not know where to start. It is interesting how it works. You take the information and then it goes to the crew?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:49:47-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's about it. I enter it, it goes to the people who schedule the work, and they go out and assess. After a storm they've got a long list, so it might take a little while."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:49:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. I will stay away from the roots. The hole is deep."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:50:04-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's smart. Keep folks clear of it, especially with the ground so soft. Anything else I can do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:50:12-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. That is all. Thank you, Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T10:50:15-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Ricci. Take care now."
    }
  ],
